IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STRINGS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FIRST PIC X(5) VALUE "ADA".
01 WS-LAST PIC X(6) VALUE "LOVELACE".
01 WS-FULL PIC X(20).
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 WS-REPL PIC X(11) VALUE "BANANA".
01 WS-A PIC X(3).
01 WS-B PIC X(5).
01 WS-C PIC X(5).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    STRING WS-FIRST DELIMITED BY SIZE " " DELIMITED BY SIZE
        WS-LAST DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-FULL.
    DISPLAY WS-FULL.
    INSPECT WS-REPL TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR ALL "A".
    DISPLAY WS-COUNT.
    INSPECT WS-REPL REPLACING ALL "A" BY "O".
    DISPLAY WS-REPL.
    UNSTRING "RED,GREEN,BLUE" DELIMITED BY "," INTO WS-A WS-B WS-C.
    DISPLAY WS-A " " WS-B " " WS-C.
    ACCEPT WS-C.
    DISPLAY WS-C.
    STOP RUN.
